    {
      "title": "Selected Bug Fixes",
      "anchor": "Selected_Bug_Fixes",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Audio",
          "anchor": "Audio",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Loki Stealth - In OB36, the attenuation radius was stealthily increased for Loki’s stealth and reveal sounds to more closely resemble SMITE 1. Player feedback revealed that the reveal attenuation did not need to be as large as the stealth attenuation, so the reveal attenuation has been reduced. Loki apologized for unnecessarily scaring players, but his hand was behind his back and may have had his fingers crossed."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Music volume has been increased at the request of Apollo."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hit sounds now duck the volume of other sounds to increase impact. I tried to write a joke for this, but Chronos said something about time being a flat circle and told me to get back to work."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Quest",
          "anchor": "Quest",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Knockup Daily Quest will now properly track for all gods with knock up abilities."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
